  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ukraine Joint Programme on CRSV Prevention &amp; Response (JP_CRSV_bridge)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is an integral part of the UN joint initiative - Ukraine Joint Programme on CRSV Prevention &amp; Response, implemented jointly by UNDP, UN Women, 	UNFPA, OHCHR, Office of the United Nations Special Representative of the Secretary-General on Sexual Violence in Conflict.Building on UNDP&#x2019;s long-standing engagement in human rights, rule of law, and access to justice, the project will provide integrated technical assistance, capacity development, and targeted operational support. The intervention prioritizes sustainability by embedding capacities within national systems and aligning with Ukraine&#x2019;s EU accession priorities and broader recovery efforts.</narrative>
  </description>
